{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1198,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8118bebe88023ec4bd4b280e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是的！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "319c75eaa07d8c089078fe32ed4460e281af7ecb030581dbb8ac64104bc89bc9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5743ceb94aa44428efbcbd0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天好像能拿到这个呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f2123a2e9a14931cd24e7001b73cc1c8b7e4191dde23b56a9308a03a756acf5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50466a8e91e3aa682525d2d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……今天不跑不行嘛？\r\n我好累哦～",
      "source_fingerprint": "893e0d505ba403661ddf1f70f584b36fc96ba39e0a796b7fc939fdaed0531a1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00336dbd1fea03137b07a431",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总感觉呢，身体不听使唤……\r\n呜呜～好烦躁啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a78a562adc5e1a8a54f6e5cdbd6a75312696d4563aec9f422f8e326dd763e3d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0f3ce3651aa9e7cb1376148",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼，无敌的帝王大人\r\n今天也状态绝佳！\r\n别被我的跑姿吓到腿软哦～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "43e4f48e78076ce3f08c9b17d8e566a2929300314178d538871c4cc945bd26d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18fa01d71a80ed647ece1186",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐呐，今天的我，\r\n肯定比之前还要厉害哟！\r\n快让我开始跑吧！快点嘛快点嘛快点嘛～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d830522317b1eba3649d00882e1e2db740530db26141fe7afc51ccb921d9f4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9e7d673fc7be26aec008374",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也要好好努力！\r\n然后像会长一样，\r\n在赛场上赢下所有的比赛～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "27e8519a60e850f0c8b351c83d4cc354d78bb8599cb9b7e98ffd0f4c080d5e26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72f1de98acbede6632d13d57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的话，无论怎样的训练\r\n都可以轻松应付哦！\r\n那么，放马过来吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "54ea003344a8c441f05723430bc72ccf47f4f4a97efc035eecf59b06a475d6fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cf94d9ebdee98f197590fa8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经准备好了！\r\n呐呐，训练员你呢？\r\n还没好吗～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d65d90c3719594fd32002da51c7533381afccbb4b1e1033f104decd4c67fa29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4389a0a00db7b947cacdbc15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好～，要上了～！\r\n瞧好了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d7660336f286004040c062874fb0b05c46f17378027b80773fe5dadf773428a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4aff99d096dba70c4a24b298",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐——今天也要训练吗？\r\n我没这个心情啦～",
      "source_fingerprint": "ceac69f0a5924c32e4b2959d06fdcad58c0c65ef895a25de65a2ca1b0154b5b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:343ced058585c70f592d77b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯——总感觉身子好沉啊……\r\n到底是怎么了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b44e9893294905fbe3ca8fca17faeb5bd5274eaaaabe8e211ac4b19a2ab82ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cfde889db3d7a780e4ce86c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果是训练员要求的话\r\n我肯定会去跑的啦……\r\n哈啊～明明就算不训练我也能赢的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "dea538e62734a35ffc06286d8c6ccdd9473d1ac7645c49ca124b53676ae1a3a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7efef180f73d2aa223b6c6d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总～感觉没有干劲呢……\r\n呜，明明还想继续跑的～……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b36021ad094860fb100614c45e0204422572a7dfcdc383e2f8d9bebf941f2c2f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:877b726ad05133d66f1b4ee7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又要比赛吗？\r\n如果是训练员要求的话会乖乖跑的……\r\n但最近不是总是在比赛嘛？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bee45279923687624c559ad9f3cf55bdbbc448d7b58eef45d74d772e9f116ca7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc6e861d999d641f8e03f2b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶诶，还要参赛～！？\r\n虽然我是喜欢比赛没错啦……\r\n但是这么一直跑的话也会累的啊～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6adf698805eb17b6209c8abf32713dcaebde4ce721bc2529db8957d51309c29c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16c99dcf57ce9b5caca08c99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好～状态绝佳！\r\n哼哼，看来这次的比赛也无法\r\n打破帝王大人的最强传说呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "40e40183f28b11c0fbc15be9c67e2b6cceb4dce7fd9b64819a029cb0ecc15743",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6251ff8c252d4f9c2aba4eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可好好地注视着我哦，训练员！\r\n因为我会“嗙嗙”地拿下比赛的，\r\n要是眨眼了的话可就要错过我的英姿了哟～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1533bf0e68064d7aaf6e2a568e7142b15e80dd81d795b9f0cb8c829570c6b55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afebb660c524d09ad3eb6451",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "反正最后的赢家肯定是我，\r\n要不就趁着现在想想到时候在领奖台时要说什么好了～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "128387c544a66f3b2ed6dd3e3f443136e2a52ff7f7c8e2fb368384a42fd8cd27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:791cd11084f352a387247b1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态，调整的很不错呢！\r\n好～、那么就干脆地拿下胜利吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e43096a57103c8a358e0e98679e7f3f105fba641c9556df7014617c7b53d5d59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82c95b756b3e56892f4d35f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼、想要挑战我无敌的帝王大人\r\n什么的真是愚蠢～♪\r\n要把你们全都甩开了哟～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb1486209f68df980584b064842b00cf67cd4fa326fb593abcefd50f244d6db9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa73a62354f0e88bfa4c9589",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜哇～，\r\n好想赶紧“蹦蹦”地跑起来啊～！\r\n我已经等不及想听到比赛开始的信号了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "432323e261c75e3f37010f5472f0691116d2af3295c033c091558422202ec886",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92c71c87f680ccf71841ace5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没问题没问题！\r\n只要像平时那样跑的话，\r\n就一定能赢的对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf630b3ab4dff171530f246a95c8e22a51a416743c0363d9503544b0154ca489",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7404d7134efca190b6dd153b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐呐，你说会长会来\r\n看我的比赛嘛～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc21c0604692a5a7bab48babd979c672edf5dfd1085a04cdd9bd4e1317e9b581",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:551ce3e925d38c63c0ff26d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好——我出发了哦！\r\n今天也要加油了——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "39db8a43902082ef2ae38989cca538275a749e679437928d5c148f7f01ee4e1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6afbe1041bdb570bc5dc051",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊……已经要开始比赛了吗。\r\n抱歉抱歉，\r\n稍微发了会儿呆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbd889f3e5c3b8dc14584d6b5831b0b67592e119ec090302fbc937a5e51a2d26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d5ecc65e3b9df731c8d93ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总感觉没啥精神呢～……\r\n虽然比赛开始的时候\r\n应该会觉得很开心的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "788dc738c4003d1806f12570a353be3662b7c0ab686e30320785d046e87a0fcf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f46140315311788022f20d90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算状态有点不太好也能赢得轻轻松松！\r\n嘛，就相信我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc28cd08dd5d56fd4aa7f18bd121e117514b047a7eb710ff9aa8ea8f4c012fb5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60947bc0ae03223112855deb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是无敌的赛马娘……\r\n所以，这种程度的比赛没问题的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "21f4ee617fc6fd312ff9a4d9aa380ed786772129ba5f046abde4381189e46c7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6447aad4c91aef91a69ec2a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我绝对，绝——对，不想输！\r\n训练员……虽然可能感觉有些不安，\r\n但是我一定会赢的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b4c013b8589559782d3753d562b1792994827d7058026fa379a85af2883d0e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7832ff4d1b86e3c917e0a92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就是状态不佳我也不会找理由哦。\r\n因为，我可要，\r\n成为无敌的赛马娘啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3abc07815820b41544d0f2608217c4a09183f7953e7cc001d31672096a0bbf9b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bad6b2ec63c9d11a20172ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc38e02b4513eef35553f27a07d4db07aba1eb7d5f1149def43fdaa8eb3351f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b148b4de2e3aa1ffebd885a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a1bc8931ce94cb5b2de86270e03f2d4b9a446effa7ceaa56679c173e0781ab6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53197c818048cf8d74e98954",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上了哟～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4f9dd7fadd977896233eee7de0b029fb0b028d0489bda0fcfe1ad64dcdf71fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a7ddb95286e7eb37b7b4821",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "13180522437c6cc592057ba23d1c2eb12ca48b6af31de93222e093c1cd1301a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b8c0f30fc5655ac55bff542",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊嘞嘞？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2517296d673a4daf8336bff986a67228ce621607ad05fd1b503d91a3d6396718",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b4aa073836392d83315d3d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不行了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "41a5616ba7f7509061166b7492945918c6126eed83d71aa9f2ca38d12c60aec1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a9ce482122eab7df7c4ebec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出～发！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d96a4b994cc95b6d6777d1afd4d87e53ea51ec2aa9d4ab41a8bc153aa53f8eaa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9f447483ef49840f1daf566",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是大海哒～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "18bf89c2b98da07d2e2403cca244f6433a2acc94223c7d12959fa1030a37b4e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9a830bed11335a4e61022e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我，很强对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad2766abb64d197c3d94499f0ea910c60848a0fb2033196e742627617a44bdb9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e6a57c3aa051215fffb45ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你，训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c78181d7abd84c3a061c42a49bc280cd76506f4c065b8afa69a10e097496add5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8272141cd2cda1878bf7f96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "撒，鼓足干劲地上了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab6f15798fbfa149fd364d1079852bf66d95ec108522bd6f0c01cf999c9770ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb0054c6c998f1e04c651819",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会赢的哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a844393e501319440e2d1cb2c9db2bed92003382707539d348a8b6940ce09696",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a6946f725a0b0437b3f8969",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家、鼓起劲地上了哦——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92faa69de31812bd3ff893fff63f29f01c0a3ab8470f8c433047933075118951",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d352881bf08dd78904c74ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你、训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "099986536521a89f332afc67db8e4df1eddb9bfadea0462586262284b167f3a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf35c54b11f2cf558e6e7f12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜哇～、好想赶紧\r\n“蹦蹦”地跑起来啊～！\r\n我已经等不及想听到比赛开始的信号了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "986bacb6c278dc1000a118db02430778def93b4085abee7708de644c0e0df567",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b09f259e8354e20942ceb0cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "反正最后的赢家肯定是我，\r\n要不就趁着现在想想\r\n到时候在领奖台时要说什么好了～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a04eadf2a539e55666e00b26c3f1ad9629a0f2dabdd6ed8dbb3ef377a64089f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51bb069a2390f2bc48c3e69d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你，训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c78181d7abd84c3a061c42a49bc280cd76506f4c065b8afa69a10e097496add5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f817e62f1eed6a4a01900c37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よ～し！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a545e34018bb476c1937d0e70712c253f155b600f2b41e78e754e284e3615b71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c67f7de2747ba07e4b8a1a52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下一次我可不会输了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4be9a983ec75596c2ed9ef42bd62d6b17c7709db551781bf8c8a8edb755bb172",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e15d75ce6de51200f16e8c17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明明就差一点点了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb2839f616f0a0be161e8b28877bef0906cb9cf9f946f7eb6d0433e8c8dc44d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e38648eeef07abc9bbbb576f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姆～姆，这种结果我可无法接受啊～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "da0c35a4ca5d6c96fc5a60941643a03ba996810747f4592e63ca98efbea565b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38c89d2809b92a9d3953bfc4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这种事什么的，肯定有哪里出问题了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e845ec8524602bb6e20fba7c9714d370cb6dd1ff4c6c0188e172f8e2fd01c8bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b26551524415a1627a523f87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯哼，看到了嘛！这就是帝王大人的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3850ecb4d9b20caa9bdca42c4daf5a7b479c59387d5fc2012a88450d6e83b3f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8484c8739fe7e1ab7e35412",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "轻轻松松，下次的第1名！我也会拿下的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8def2a8a589602b0e19f5313c0efc5f94684da10c2cdd589433aae5a7f337e42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6963899f713de681e8f81b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "HOP！STEP！……大胜——利！VV！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4b0e9fc9688c505afc3f9277c6819ce28a473d44e602f9590ac178852af25c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0901bb83813f439e449165c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "轻轻松松，下次的第1名！我也会拿下的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8def2a8a589602b0e19f5313c0efc5f94684da10c2cdd589433aae5a7f337e42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2bf04e67a8ac9b673d246da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これにて終幕！\r\nまさに神業、だったでしょ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f7dc2ac031375e4b73b6af7da4a433b0df3a86604badd6e06f3ba1589c1a229",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "30206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:155b95f0abd8a55fbf3abff3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "轻轻松松，下次的第1名！我也会拿下的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8def2a8a589602b0e19f5313c0efc5f94684da10c2cdd589433aae5a7f337e42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "30207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:faf894939154379c7d645d77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1517fbd3c7a4b1a9bc6c0f2a21ca4dcc3ad0db20e4ce267cdba0767e3af1e843",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e870aaca4dc686c0ce972933",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赢家肯定是我，帝王大人哒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "30a4a53a3e2e689ba772203bf68ac59989b59e4b440ef4dd9e218ac116c5e33c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a89ccef9696b805efd5d104",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走るのってホンットにキモチイイ！\r\nこれからもたっくさん、みんなに\r\nカッコいいところ見せるぞ～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5314b4ca18f8f542d2539ffce9ec54ec9850e9b0f76b0c53b0200bf40bfb95a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:345337fd56581ce1e743c4e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ボクが強い理由？\r\nへへ、それは…\r\nヒミツ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "912dc2ef795c60a86a49b5617eeb61ec8cf82c36628c3c71d007b762b28e5475",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1033542716f38be06e4ee65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是比赛或舞蹈，\r\n赢家的宝座都是我的！\r\n这才是帝王大人，对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "233373e5a040d6078e4dc6a6dfefb367273af579e0dc866de607961b71ad36e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "400004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d2bfb4a5e35e49284f7f7b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正式上场的服装是很帅气\r\n没错啦……嗳～麦昆。至少\r\n蝴蝶结让我绑松一点好不好～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a6c4718562887c8fdff9a6a0c7bf156fd5cc2ab4f739559bc47355a6f8db3dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eaef11664112083b96575a55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目标当然是让所有人\r\n都能开心的完美结局啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "721bf66b4aed4623310e4f6fddaa2fe7a88dbde56150c019efd02244f529bbd0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "400008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10cad2a29cdcaf9ed09a9f2e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "究——极！无敌的——！嘿！帝王舞步哒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f81d8071b073729de17839c762ee3f84795c094de7bd9f218e580112382cfb1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e6a8c487b42e39a0501c039",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "すごい熱気だった…\r\nきっと、歴代で1番だ。…絶対に。\r\n――見てたか、シンボリルドルフ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a21ca414a5f699d9aa99a6aacee160776779d3ff52b81f28d5aeb50164e8d6c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "400010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7ed992a62bcdf47628ff095",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欢迎来到活动任务。\r\n看来……你不需要我的领导啊。\r\n……嘻嘻嘻，加油哦～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "50550f893498676b01f4cf10611f4e298e83fa4ac8a7b72ed81b0f9258f6c322",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6a0f5581e8d8a244cc0b154",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。\r\n帝王大人来称赞你的努力～\r\n尽管收下奖励吧～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d9aaae985f6b0d9e31f286a232be9e28b8f996281a2d3866a9d920660a9cca8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c6b0c08b5ec86e0b0ca8303",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "绝对要赢——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6096e4ebe68fc27f2f6a93935da80b335e676150475d56f5b6ae37487156627",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88a87350de3ed078654d8589",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "她们三人一起拍的广告真是帅气！\r\n广告里有拍到几处街景对吧？\r\n好想快点实际去玩玩喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1d1a5b0401724add52dceafd2b95be30b0e4419b07f9c02b1849ca9e27e42cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "400031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f23759c38b6e2d477b367aa5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……用这股力量的话……！\r\n哈啊啊啊啊！帝王传说从这开始——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "112b4c2990d676d373108b873f3f674db0e4a26a76a49ef1006a2979369bb421",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45244b95df93fc62c8dda89e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "カイチョーの後を継ぐのはボク！\r\nカイチョーを超えるのもボク！\r\n誰にも譲らないもんね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a50ce0679d08fd1149635a43267daec4129677ea3896034ac0d654737d1c00f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "400061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab6475480f46c8b08ef44c95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "テイオーの舞い、ご照覧あれ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "baf08b66ad8e311ea38eadec109f9272f2383223a757809f55b8cbbc7184d4ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "40203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab51cbd8c659c93c04327994",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "流麗に舞う胡蝶にして、\r\nその早駆けは旋風の如し――\r\nどう？ボクに見とれちゃった？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f35fc728fb2212d513141e7b599015f3fd175ecdfab2b620474fe80e8644d1d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "40204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76ec60654cf13efc5254d04b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要上啰──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "12061afd2ebc3e8665a88908d6a82610379b1355c7d6cacc914896b1be3e2fb1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "410000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b98e13e029ccbd6b8a84da2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太棒了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7d8f20cc956a8d520b2af7240c22e9b3d9150c1ad2835de85b9a4cf4eab1a44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "410001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e010aa942440692a5a870f3c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "耶──耶──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0976cd6841156d248a388b0c35447ec43110d4297195e6c6cd3b149e0a42f7fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "410002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9dfccd2e961d349c3419e0c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "耶──耶──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0976cd6841156d248a388b0c35447ec43110d4297195e6c6cd3b149e0a42f7fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
